title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf gui command
catalog: CLI command
target: mf gui command
summary: Run a command invocation through the GUI (same as the command input)

!! Reference

```
Run a command invocation through the GUI (same as the command input)

Usage: mf gui command [OPTIONS] <INVOCATION>...

Arguments:
  <INVOCATION>...
          The command invocation, e.g. `panel:open here file`

Options:
      --timeout-ms <TIMEOUT_MS>
          

      --confirm <CONFIRM>
          Answer every confirmation the command asks while it runs (yes or no), and print the questions; without it they are the user's
          
          [possible values: yes, no]

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
